 at the orgy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/whDFT8qgctPT4mIwFS48OJGiihb.jpg"},{"id":1818722,"name":"Fabien Cahen","role":"The guitarist at the party","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iGi3MLdsmXTTIg0xIrM9Pl4UzR2.jpg"},{"id":79529,"name":"Eric Cornet","role":"The counter neighbor"},{"id":3322186,"name":"Tam Ara","role":"Housekeeper at dinner (uncredited)"},{"id":2496663,"name":"Arnaud de Montlivault","role":"Louis XVI (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1fQcowAkSvSezYxo2ptcka1bw9O.jpg"},{"id":1871415,"name":"Emmanuel Ménard","role":"Hitler lookalike (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/caXKuLYcdxQCzMpTolcTOpCImDD.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La belle époque","overview":"Daniel Auteuil è Victor, un uomo all’antica che odia il presente digitale. Quando un eccentrico imprenditore, grazie all’uso di scenografie cinematografiche, comparse e un po’ di trucchi di scena, gli propone di rivivere il giorno più bello della sua vita, Victor non ha dubbi. Sceglie di tornare a Lione il 16 maggio del 1974: il giorno in cui ha incontrato la donna della sua vita. Una sceneggiatura da Oscar® per un cast all-star, da Fanny Ardant a Pierre Arditi, da Guillaume Canet alla rivelazione di Cannes 2019 Doria Tillier. Una regia elegante e un ritmo sorprendente, capace di far ridere ed emozionare il pubblico di ogni età.","tagline":"E se potessi rivevere il giorno più felice della tua vita?"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Victor, a disillusioned 60-something whose marriage is on the rocks, opts to relive the week of his life when, 40 years earlier, he met his true love through a company that allows customers to return to the time period of their choosing.","tagline":"If you could live your own life again, would you do it?"},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Victor, un sexagénaire désabusé, voit sa vie bouleversée le jour où Antoine, un brillant entrepreneur, lui propose une attraction d’un genre nouveau: mélangeant artifices théâtraux et reconstitution historique, cette entreprise propose à ses clients de replonger dans l’époque de leur choix. Victor choisit alors de revivre la semaine la plus marquante de sa vie: celle où, 40 ans plus tôt, il rencontra le grand amour...","tagline":"Si vous pouviez revivre votre passé, que choisiriez-vous ?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cRnawvVOCHJtJqDsorOgN5jCrmJ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sfoaAbgEQlQI8dBFJsiIdXiLI7x.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":595975,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cRnawvVOCHJtJqDsorOgN5jCrmJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cRnawvVOCHJtJqDsorOgN5jCrmJ.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cRnawvVOCHJtJqDsorOgN5jCrmJ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cRnawvVOCHJtJqDsorOgN5jCrmJ.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ddv5dgS23zpEM4h6RhgyjkDrZfB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ddv5dgS23zpEM4h6RhgyjkDrZfB.jpg","language":"it","width":1984,"height":2835},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s2UStPzXb8uPd9Yf3Hb4z8Qth0U.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s2UStPzXb8uPd9Yf3Hb4z8Qth0U.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eHojoVxYRyqGABgoiTYyfkYqTra.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eHojoVxYRyqGABgoiTYyfkYqTra.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url